  [1165.0s] mkbg_home：背景紀錄（開始～結束）[{"k": "mk_start", "t": "", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 8.505, "active": true, "isMk": false, "isHome": true, "img": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp\")", "cls": "on image", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}, {"k": "setBg", "t": "{\"image\":\"assets/bg/linze_201.webp\"}", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 10, "active": true, "isMk": true, "isHome": false, "img": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/linze_201.webp\")", "cls": "on image", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}, {"k": "say", "t": "（法律系館A 201。前面幾排零零散散坐了四五個人。有人穿著實習的襯衫，有人一邊吃早餐一邊翻講義。）", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 10, "active": true, "isMk": true, "isHome": false, "img": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/linze_201.webp\")", "cls": "on image", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}, {"k": "say", "t": "1／5　乙月薪 6 萬元（自然人因提供勞務而獲得的繼續性報酬）。債權人聲請扣押乙的薪資，執行法院沒有認定有失公平的特殊情形。每個月原則上最多可以扣押多少？", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 10, "active": true, "isMk": true, "isHome": false, "img": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/linze_201.webp\")", "cls": "on image", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}, {"k": "say", "t": "2／5　法院強制執行時，查封了債務人乙家中的一架鋼琴，但這架鋼琴其實是鄰居丙寄放的，所有權屬於丙。丙在強制執行程序終結前，最適合提起什麼訴訟？", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 10, "active": true, "isMk": true, "isHome": false, "img": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/linze_201.webp\")", "cls": "on image narr", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}, {"k": "say", "t": "3／5　執行人員到作家乙家裡查封，看到：一部還沒發表的小說手稿、一支名牌手錶、一輛很少開的跑車、乙名下另一間出租的房子。依強制執行法第53條，哪一樣原則上不得查", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 10, "active": true, "isMk": true, "isHome": false, "img": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/linze_201.webp\")", "cls": "on image narr", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}, {"k": "say", "t": "4／5　確定判決命乙清償 50 萬元。判決確定後，乙已經全部清償，債權人甲仍持判決聲請強制執行。乙在執行程序終結前，可以提起什麼訴訟？", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 10, "active": true, "isMk": true, "isHome": false, "img": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/linze_201.webp\")", "cls": "on image narr", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}, {"k": "say", "t": "5／5　甲持有乙親筆簽名的借據，乙到期不還。甲可不可以直接拿這張借據，向法院聲請強制執行？", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 10, "active": true, "isMk": true, "isHome": false, "img": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/linze_201.webp\")", "cls": "on image narr", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}, {"k": "setBg", "t": "{\"image\":\"assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp\"}", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 11, "active": true, "isMk": false, "isHome": true, "img": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp\")", "cls": "on narr image", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}, {"k": "mk_end", "t": "true", "d": "2029-06-26", "h": 11, "active": true, "isMk": false, "isHome": true, "img": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "dom": "url(\"assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp\")", "cls": "on narr image", "mkImg": "assets/bg/linze_201.webp", "homeImg": "assets/bg/home_dining_day.webp", "zone": "dorm", "seat": false}]
